      'Creating a vibrant and user-friendly photo gallery webpage involves combining HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to ensure functionality and aesthetic appeal. Below is a comprehensive example of how you can achieve this:\n\n### HTML (index.html)\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang="en">\n<head>\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\n    <title>Photo Gallery</title>\n    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class="container">\n        <h1>Photo Gallery</h1>\n        <div class="upload-section">\n            <input type="file" id="upload-input" accept="image/*" multiple>\n            <button id="upload-button">Upload Photos</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class="gallery" id="gallery"></div>\n    </div>\n    <script src="scripts.js"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n### CSS (styles.css)\n```css\nbody {\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6d365 0%, #fda085 100%);\n    color: #fff;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n}\n\n.container {\n    width: 80%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding-top: 50px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n    font-size: 3em;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.upload-section {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n\n#upload-input {\n    display: none;\n}\n\n#upload-button {\n    background-color: #ff6f61;\n    color: white;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    font-size: 1.2em;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n#upload-button:hover {\n    background-color: #ff3b2f;\n}\n\n.gallery {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 15px;\n}\n\n.gallery img {\n    width: 200px;\n    height: 200px;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.gallery img:hover {\n    transform: scale(1.05);\n}\n```\n\n### JavaScript (scripts.js)\n```javascript\ndocument.getElementById(\'upload-button\').addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\n    document.getElementById(\'upload-input\').click();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById(\'upload-input\').addEventListener(\'change\', (event) => {\n    const files = event.target.files;\n    const gallery = document.getElementById(\'gallery\');\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < files.length; i++) {\n        const file = files[i];\n        const reader = new FileReader();\n\n        reader.onload = function(e) {\n            const img = document.createElement(\'img\');\n            img.src = e.target.result;\n            gallery.appendChild(img);\n        };\n\n        reader.readAsDataURL(file);\n    }\n});\n```\n\n### Explanation:\n1. **HTML**: Creates the basic structure of the webpage, including a section for uploading photos and a gallery to display them.\n2. **CSS**: Adds a colorful and visually appealing design with a gradient background, styled buttons, and a responsive gallery layout. The gallery images have hover effects to enhance interactivity.\n3. **JavaScript**: Handles the functionality for uploading images. When the user selects photos, they are read and displayed dynamically in the gallery.\n\nThis combination ensures a vibrant, user-friendly photo gallery where users can easily upload and view their images.',
