      'To change the base URL of an Angular app so it can run in a sub-path, you\'ll need to update the `base href` in your `index.html` file and configure the `deploy-url` and `base-href` in your `angular.json` file. Here\'s a step-by-step guide:\n\n1. **Update the base href in index.html:**\n\n   Open your `src/index.html` file and find the `<base href="/">` line. Change the `href` attribute to match your desired sub-path. For example, if you want your app to run at `https://example.com/my-app`, change the line to:\n\n   ```html\n   <base href="/my-app/">\n   ```\n\n2. **Configure deploy-url and base-href in angular.json:**\n\n   Open your `angular.json` file and look for the `projects -> your-project-name -> architect -> build -> options` section. Add or update the following configurations:\n\n   ```json\n   "projects": {\n     "your-project-name": {\n       "architect": {\n         "build": {\n           "options": {\n             "baseHref": "/my-app/",\n             "deployUrl": "/my-app/"\n           }\n         }\n       }\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n\n   Replace `your-project-name` with the name of your project and `my-app` with your desired sub-path.\n\n3. **Update the package.json scripts (optional but recommended):**\n\n   To ensure that your build scripts use the updated configurations, open your `package.json` file and update the `build` and `serve` scripts as follows:\n\n   ```json\n   "scripts": {\n     "ng": "ng",\n     "start": "ng serve",\n     "build": "ng build --base-href=/my-app/ --deploy-url=/my-app/",\n     "watch": "ng build --watch --base-href=/my-app/ --deploy-url=/my-app/",\n     "test": "ng test"\n   }\n   ```\n\n   Again, replace `my-app` with your desired sub-path.\n\n4. **Rebuild your project:**\n\n   After making these changes, rebuild your project using the following command:\n\n   ```\n   ng build\n   ```\n\nNow, your Angular app should be configured to run at the specified sub-path. When you deploy your app, make sure to place the contents of the `dist` folder (generated after building the project) at the root of your sub-path on your server. For example, if your sub-path is `my-app`, place the contents of the `dist` folder at `https://example.com/my-app`.',
